OL,3,C'Highly dangerous' travel adaptors
OL,4,Cfound for sale to UK consumers
OL,6,F"Highly dangerous" travel adaptors
OL,7,Fhave been found for sale to UK
OL,8,Fconsumers on major online
OL,9,Fmarketplaces, a charity has warned.
OL,11,FAll 14 devices bought by Electrical
OL,12,FSafety First from Ali Express, eBay,
OL,13,FAmazon Marketplace and TikTok Shop
OL,14,Ffailed basic safety tests, with the
OL,15,Fworst offenders posing a risk of
OL,16,Fserious electric shock or even
OL,17,Felectrocution.
OL,26,@nD@AOUnD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
