FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785383018
OL,3,C'Highly dangerous' travel adaptors
OL,4,Cfound for sale to UK consumers
OL,6,FSix basic travel adaptors failed a
OL,7,Fvariety of safety tests including:
OL,8,Fsome missing safety shutters, which
OL,9,Fprotect users from touching live
OL,10,Finternal parts; missing fuses,
OL,11,Fincreasing the risk of fire; oversized
OL,12,Fplug pin holes, making it easier to
OL,13,Fcome into contact with live electrical
OL,14,Fparts; and devices that accepted three-
OL,15,Fpin plugs without providing an earth
OL,16,Fconnection, removing an important
OL,17,Flayer of protection against electric
OL,18,Fshock.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
