FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785383018
OL,3,C'Highly dangerous' travel adaptors
OL,4,Cfound for sale to UK consumers
OL,6,FFour universal and two basic travel
OL,7,Fadaptors underwent further testing in
OL,8,Fan external specialist laboratory to
OL,9,Fassess the fire resistance and
OL,10,Fflammability of the plastic materials
OL,11,Fused in the product.
OL,13,FAll six samples failed this test.
OL,15,FGiuseppe Capanna, product safety
OL,16,Fengineer at Electrical Safety First,
OL,17,Fsaid: "Shopping for your holiday
OL,18,Fgetaway should be an enjoyable
OL,19,Fexperience, not one that puts you at
OL,20,Fserious risk.
OL,26,@yD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
