PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785383018
OL,3,C'Highly dangerous' travel adaptors
OL,4,Cfound for sale to UK consumers
OL,6,F"Shoppers in the UK shouldn't have to
OL,7,Fquestion whether the products they buy
OL,8,Fmight put them at risk, yet our
OL,9,Finvestigation shows that dangerous
OL,10,Felectrical goods are still finding
OL,11,Ftheir way into people's homes through
OL,12,Fonline marketplaces.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
