PN,31407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785383018
OL,3,C'Highly dangerous' travel adaptors
OL,4,Cfound for sale to UK consumers
OL,6,F"What looks like a bargain could come
OL,7,Fat a much higher cost. We urge Brits
OL,8,Fheading abroad this summer to think
OL,9,Fbefore they buy and only purchase
OL,10,Ftravel adaptors from reputable
OL,11,Fretailers they know and trust, so they
OL,12,Fcan travel with confidence and avoid
OL,13,Ftaking a potentially dangerous device
OL,14,Faway with them."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@PO]
