OL,3,C'Highly dangerous' travel adaptors
OL,4,Cfound for sale to UK consumers
OL,6,FA spokeswoman for AliExpress said: "We
OL,7,Fhave removed the three travel adapter
OL,8,Flistings identified by Electrical
OL,9,FSafety First and are contacting
OL,10,Faffected customers to initiate a
OL,11,Frecall through our established
OL,12,Fchannels.
OL,14,F"We have also launched a wider review
OL,15,Fof universal travel adapter listings
OL,16,Fwhere all plug pins are shown extended
OL,17,Fat the same time. Any listing with
OL,18,Fthis unsafe characteristic will be
OL,19,Frestricted from sale until the seller
OL,20,Ftakes corrective action."
OL,26,@nD@dOUvD@AOU|D@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
