PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785383018
OL,3,C'Highly dangerous' travel adaptors
OL,4,Cfound for sale to UK consumers
OL,6,FA spokeswoman for eBay said: "We have
OL,7,Fremoved the listings identified by
OL,8,FElectrical Safety First and we're
OL,9,Fcarrying out wider checks to find and
OL,10,Fremove any similar listings."
OL,12,FAn Amazon spokesman said: "The
OL,13,Fproducts identified have been removed
OL,14,Ffrom sale."
OL,16,FTikTok also removed the listings.
