PN,31410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785383018
OL,3,C'Highly dangerous' travel adaptors
OL,4,Cfound for sale to UK consumers
OL,6,FAndrew McConnell, spokesman for the UK
OL,7,FCivil Aviation Authority, said: "The
OL,8,Ffindings by Electrical Safety First
OL,9,Fare a useful reminder that travellers
OL,10,Fshould take care when buying
OL,11,Felectrical products and accessories
OL,12,Ffor use on holiday.
OL,14,F"Whether it's a travel adaptor, power
OL,15,Fbank or vape, using trusted products
OL,16,Fand following guidance can help reduce
OL,17,Fsafety risks."
OL,26,@oD@aOUvD@AOUyD@NO]
